OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,FPolice are continuing to investigate a
OL,7,Fstabbing in central London after four
OL,8,Fmen were injured in what officers
OL,9,Fdescribed as an "isolated, mental
OL,10,Fhealth" attack.
OL,12,FA 47-year-old woman is in police
OL,13,Fcustody following the attack on
OL,14,FWednesday in Covent Garden, the
OL,15,Fcapital's busy tourist area filled
OL,16,Fwith bars, theatres and restaurants.
OL,18,FShe was arrested on suspicion of
OL,19,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,20,Fbelieved to be a pair of scissors, and
OL,21,Fassault.
OL,26,@qD@QOUrD@GO]
