OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,FTwo men are being treated in hospital
OL,7,Ffor injuries which are not life-
OL,8,Fthreatening or life-changing and two
OL,9,Fmore have been discharged.
OL,11,FEarlier, Arjan Gjorga, who manages a
OL,12,Ffish and chip shop in Endell Street,
OL,13,Fsaid the victims were "random people
OL,14,Fwho were just walking by".
OL,16,FMr Gjorga, 48, told the Press
OL,17,FAssociation: "She just started
OL,18,Fstabbing random people. I didn't see
OL,19,Fany scissors, but I heard it was with
OL,20,Fsmall scissors.
OL,26,@uD@WOUvD@YO]yD@NOU
