OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,F"We saw this lady after a few minutes
OL,7,Fbeing arrested ` the police responded
OL,8,Fimmediately."
OL,10,FAnother witness described the woman
OL,11,Fwho was arrested as homeless, adding
OL,12,Fthat she was regularly seen in Endell
OL,13,FStreet and the surrounding area.
OL,15,FMatt Bishop, 42, who works at a
OL,16,Fconsultancy firm next to the cordon in
OL,17,FCovent Garden, said he had seen a
OL,18,Fwoman having a "stand-off" with three
OL,19,Fpolice officers and waving a weapon
OL,20,Faround.
