OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,FHe said: "I didn't see the stabbing. I
OL,7,Fsaw her running down the road towards
OL,8,Fthe crossroads. She looked quite old,
OL,9,Fshort hair.
OL,11,F"There was a bit of a stand-off with
OL,12,Fthree police officers.
OL,14,F"She didn't seem to be particularly
OL,15,Fcoherent. She was pretty incoherent in
OL,16,Fwhat she was shouting, the officer was
OL,17,Fasking what language she was shouting."
