OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,FAnother witness said the stabbing
OL,7,Fhappened outside the Shaftesbury
OL,8,FTheatre before the woman made her way
OL,9,Fdown Endell Street.
OL,11,FThe witness, who wanted to remain
OL,12,Fanonymous, said: "We noticed she
OL,13,Fstabbed three people with scissors by
OL,14,Fthe theatre, then she came down here
OL,15,Fand the police were here."
OL,17,FA spokesman for St Mungo's homeless
OL,18,Fcharity, which works in the Endell
OL,19,FStreet area, said: "Our thoughts are
OL,20,Fwith everyone who has been affected by
OL,21,Fthis distressing incident.
OL,26,@tD@ROUwD@ZO]{D@TOU
