OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,F"We are working closely with emergency
OL,7,Fservices to ensure that all of the
OL,8,Fpeople we support, in addition to our
OL,9,Fcolleagues, are safe and accounted
OL,10,Ffor."
OL,12,FA large police cordon was put up from
OL,13,FHigh Holborn to the St Mungo's
OL,14,Fhomeless centre in Endell Street,
OL,15,Fwhere officers were speaking to people
OL,16,Fbefore they entered the building.
