OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,FAn air ambulance helicopter landed in
OL,7,Fa packed Trafalgar Square, but London
OL,8,FAmbulance Service, which was called
OL,9,Fout at 12.29pm, later said it had
OL,10,F"treated four patients at the scene
OL,11,Fand took them all to a major trauma
OL,12,Fcentre as a priority by road".
OL,14,FRestaurants near the cordon towards
OL,15,FLong Acre continued their business.
OL,17,FChief Superintendent Jason Stewart,
OL,18,Fwho leads policing in the area, said:
OL,19,F"Officers responded within minutes of
OL,20,Fthis incident after receiving a number
OL,21,Fof reports.
