OL,3,CPolice continue to investigate Covent
OL,4,CGarden attack after woman arrested
OL,6,F"While still at an early stage of the
OL,7,Finvestigation, we would like to
OL,8,Freassure the community that we
OL,9,Fcurrently believe this to be an
OL,10,Fisolated, mental-health related
OL,11,Fincident."
OL,13,FThe injured men were aged 34, 39, 42
OL,14,Fand 52.
